{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Magic Well to enter the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, fight unique ink monsters and become a wizard who gathered all the wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.poster.avif?t=1758146356\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.webm?t=1758146356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.mp4?t=1758146356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/0e60259ba523b14a524b9aa0989117e4.avif?t=1758146356\" width=616 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d533358abc3072a6917fff5afe19de06.avif?t=1758146356\" width=616 height=309 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, you will be able to unlock new items and rooms that will appear in the dungeon. Level up your character to face the new challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2140310?t=1758146356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/9c7318e5873b8807337bc70329e28c13a800bf64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758146356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/49cd49dc9734cee78e713a64726b174b2f160cc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758146356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/49cd49dc9734cee78e713a64726b174b2f160cc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758146356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3716400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the Magic Well to enter the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, fight unique ink monsters and become a wizard who gathered all the wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/d6640cb0abbc7c2c3401ae2ad2d6e99c.poster.avif?t=1758146356\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps